## 5. IBKR Execution Sync Logging Reviewed

**File:** `lib/server/brokers/ibkr/fetchFlex.ts`

### Review findings

The file logs:

- IBKR account ID.
- Flex query ID.
- XML length.
- Number of parsed executions.
- Whether synchronization was skipped because no executions were found.

It does not log the complete XML statement.

### Decision

**No changes made.**

The account-ID and query-ID logs were retained because they help diagnose broker-sync issues. We did not establish a sufficiently strong reason to remove these identifiers from the operational logs.

The existing zero-execution safeguard and atomic broker-execution replacement call remain unchanged.

